{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01MdxCugD5o7YaebD38w2jvB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Project State Summary\n\n**Problem**: GNU coreutils have no formal specs accessible to implementers. This project derives formal specifications from C source, generates Go implementations via AI agent, and verifies parity through differential testing against Homebrew GNU reference binaries.\n\n**Architecture**: Four-stage pipeline (extract → specify → synthesize → verify). Shared libraries in `pkg/` (testutils, sys, format, hashutil, sizeparse, encutil), per-utility implementations in `cmd/`, specs in `docs/specs/`. Code generation driven by mage-claude-orchestrator; specs are human-authored.\n\n**Current state**: 114 SRDs specified across 33 releases (00.0–15.0). Many utilities implemented (sponge, du, true, false, yes, basename, dirname, tee, head, seq, wc, uname, arch, hostname, hostid, realpath, readlink, pwd, tty, nl, fold, unexpand, plus pkg/ infrastructure). This is generation-run44 -- task #5283 just merged, updating requirement states.\n\n**Current release**: rel05.2 (cut, paste). For cut, R1–R3 were handled by task #5283 (merged); R4.1–R4.4 remain ready. For paste, all 14 requirements (R1.1–R4.4) are ready -- no work done yet.\n\n## Priority Analysis\n\nEarliest incomplete release with ready requirements: **rel05.2** (cut and paste).\n\n- **srd026-cut**: Only R4.1–R4.4 remain (4 requirements). R1–R3 completed by task #5283.\n- **srd027-paste**: All R1.1–R4.4 ready (14 requirements). Fresh implementation needed.\n\nDependencies: cut R4 depends on existing cut implementation from R1–R3. Paste R1 is independent (new package). Paste R2 depends on R1, R3 depends on R2.\n\n## Weight Budget Checks\n\n```\nTask 0: cmd/cut srd026-cut R4.1(w=1) + R4.2(w=1) + R4.3(w=1) + R4.4(w=1) = 4 ≤ 4 ✓\nTask 1: cmd/paste srd027-paste R1.1(w=1) + R1.2(w=1) + R1.3(w=1) + R1.4(w=1) = 4 ≤ 4 ✓\nTask 2: cmd/paste srd027-paste R2.1(w=1) + R2.2(w=1) + R2.3(w=1) = 3 ≤ 4 ✓\nTask 3: cmd/paste srd027-paste R3.1(w=1) + R3.2(w=1) + R3.3(w=1) = 3 ≤ 4 ✓\n```\n\nAll within budget. Paste R4.1–R4.4 deferred to next batch.\n\n## Proposed Tasks\n\n```yaml\n- index: 0\n  title: \"cmd/cut -- srd026 R4.1-R4.4\"\n  dependency: -1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd026-cut.yaml (requirements R4.1 through R4.4)\n      - cmd/cut/main.go (existing cut implementation -- R1 through R3 already implemented)\n      - pkg/testutils/ (DiffTest struct and RunDiffTests function for differential testing)\n      - CLAUDE.md (differential testing pattern, SIGPIPE, and BuildBinary conventions)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/cut/cut_test.go\n        action: create\n        note: Differential tests for cut using testutils.RunDiffTests against gcut\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Implement srd026-cut requirement R4.1 exactly as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Implement srd026-cut requirement R4.2 exactly as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Implement srd026-cut requirement R4.3 exactly as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R4\n        text: \"Implement srd026-cut requirement R4.4 exactly as specified in the SRD\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Use testutils.BuildBinary(t, \\\".\\\") to compile cmd/cut and exec.LookPath(\\\"gcut\\\") for the GNU reference binary\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Call t.Skip if the reference binary gcut is not found in PATH\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"Set LC_ALL=C in the Env field of each DiffTest to ensure consistent ordering between Go and GNU binaries\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"cmd/cut/cut_test.go exists with a TestDiff function using testutils.RunDiffTests\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"Each of the four SRD requirements R4.1 through R4.4 is covered by at least 